### KAPJ Flow — BPJS Service REST Client Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@serviceKey = kapj_service_key_for_testing_1234567890_min32

### 1. Health Check BPJS
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Verifikator BPJS (dr. Triana M.)
# @name loginBPJS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "triana.mayasari@bpjs-kesehatan.go.id",
  "password": "reviewerBpjs2025!"
}

### Simpan token
@authToken = {{loginBPJS.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 3. Get Profil Verifikator BPJS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. [T-202] Dashboard Summary Review Klaim BPJS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. [T-202] Daftar Klaim Masuk BPJS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims?filter=ALL&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. [T-202] Antrean Klaim SLA Urgent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims?filter=SLA_URGENT
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. [T-203] Detail Klaim SUB-BPJS-001
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-BPJS-001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. [T-203] Update Status Review (IN_REVIEW)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-BPJS-001/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_REVIEW",
  "notes": "Sedang memverifikasi kesesuaian koding diagnosis Ina-CBGs"
}

### 9. [T-203] Keputusan Adjudikasi BPJS — SETUJU (APPROVED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-BPJS-001/decide
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "APPROVED",
  "approved_amount": 37500000,
  "compliance_checks": {
    "jkn_active": true,
    "referral_valid": true,
    "icd_coding_match": true,
    "no_duplicate_claim": true
  },
  "reviewer_notes": "Klaim sesuai indikasi medis dan regulasi Ina-CBGs Kelas 1 rawat inap. Disetujui penuh untuk batas pertanggungan primer."
}

### 10. [T-203] Keputusan Alternatif — Minta Revisi Berkas
